sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant CLI as nmesos CLI
    participant ConfigReader as Config Reader
    participant YamlFile as YAML File
    participant Validator as Validator
    participant SingularityMgr as Singularity Manager
    participant SingularityAPI as Singularity API
    participant Mesos as Apache Mesos
    participant Docker as Docker Runtime
    
    Note over User,Docker: Release Command Flow
    
    User->>CLI: nmesos release service-name<br/>--environment prod --tag v1.2.3
    
    CLI->>CLI: Parse CLI arguments
    CLI->>ConfigReader: Load configuration
    ConfigReader->>YamlFile: Read service-name.yml
    YamlFile-->>ConfigReader: YAML content
    ConfigReader->>ConfigReader: Parse YAML structure
    ConfigReader->>ConfigReader: Extract environment config
    ConfigReader-->>CLI: ValidConfig
    
    CLI->>Validator: Validate configuration
    Validator->>Validator: Check resource limits
    Validator->>Validator: Validate deprecated env vars
    Validator->>Validator: Check version compatibility
    Validator-->>CLI: Validation results
    
    alt Validation fails
        CLI-->>User: ❌ Configuration errors
    else Validation succeeds
        CLI->>SingularityMgr: Create manager instance
        
        Note over SingularityMgr,SingularityAPI: Check connectivity
        SingularityMgr->>SingularityAPI: GET /api/requests (ping)
        SingularityAPI-->>SingularityMgr: 200 OK
        
        Note over SingularityMgr,SingularityAPI: Check existing request
        SingularityMgr->>SingularityAPI: GET /api/requests/request/{requestId}
        
        alt Request doesn't exist
            SingularityAPI-->>SingularityMgr: 404 Not Found
            SingularityMgr->>SingularityAPI: POST /api/requests<br/>(create new request)
            SingularityAPI-->>SingularityMgr: 201 Created
        else Request exists but differs
            SingularityAPI-->>SingularityMgr: 200 OK (request data)
            SingularityMgr->>SingularityMgr: Compare configurations
            SingularityMgr->>SingularityAPI: POST /api/requests<br/>(update request)
            SingularityAPI-->>SingularityMgr: 200 Updated
        else Request is up to date
            SingularityAPI-->>SingularityMgr: 200 OK (no changes needed)
        end
        
        Note over SingularityMgr,SingularityAPI: Check deployment history
        SingularityMgr->>SingularityAPI: GET /api/history/request/{requestId}/deploy/{deployId}
        
        alt Deploy doesn't exist
            SingularityAPI-->>SingularityMgr: 404 Not Found
            SingularityMgr->>SingularityAPI: POST /api/deploys<br/>(create new deploy)
            SingularityAPI-->>SingularityMgr: 201 Deploy Created
        else Deploy exists but force flag set
            SingularityAPI-->>SingularityMgr: 200 OK (deploy exists)
            SingularityMgr->>SingularityMgr: Generate new deploy ID
            SingularityMgr->>SingularityAPI: POST /api/deploys<br/>(force redeploy)
            SingularityAPI-->>SingularityMgr: 201 Deploy Created
        else Deploy exists without force
            SingularityAPI-->>SingularityMgr: 200 OK (deploy exists)
            SingularityMgr-->>CLI: ❌ Deploy exists, use --force
        end
        
        Note over SingularityAPI,Docker: Mesos orchestrates deployment
        SingularityAPI->>Mesos: Schedule tasks
        Mesos->>Docker: Pull container image
        Docker-->>Mesos: Image pulled
        Mesos->>Docker: Start container instances
        Docker-->>Mesos: Containers started
        Mesos-->>SingularityAPI: Task status updates
        
        Note over SingularityMgr,SingularityAPI: Monitor deployment progress
        loop Until deployment complete
            SingularityMgr->>SingularityAPI: GET /api/deploys/pending
            SingularityAPI-->>SingularityMgr: Pending deploy status
            SingularityMgr->>CLI: Update progress animation
        end
        
        SingularityMgr->>SingularityAPI: GET /api/history/request/{requestId}/deploy/{deployId}
        SingularityAPI-->>SingularityMgr: Deploy history with results
        
        alt Deployment successful
            SingularityMgr->>SingularityAPI: GET /api/tasks/active
            SingularityAPI-->>SingularityMgr: Active task information
            SingularityMgr->>CLI: Format task information
            CLI-->>User: ✅ Deployment successful<br/>Task details and port mappings
            
            opt After deploy jobs configured
                Note over CLI,SingularityAPI: Process after_deploy chain
                loop For each after_deploy job
                    CLI->>CLI: Create new command for job
                    Note over CLI,SingularityAPI: Recursive deployment
                end
            end
            
        else Deployment failed
            SingularityMgr->>SingularityAPI: GET /api/sandbox/{taskId}/read?path=stderr
            SingularityAPI-->>SingularityMgr: Error logs
            SingularityMgr->>CLI: Format error information
            CLI-->>User: ❌ Deployment failed<br/>Error logs and details
            
            opt On failure job configured
                Note over CLI,SingularityAPI: Execute failure job
                CLI->>CLI: Create failure command
                Note over CLI,SingularityAPI: Execute failure deployment
            end
        end
    end
    
    Note over User,Docker: Alternative: Dry Run Mode
    alt Dry run mode (--dry-run true)
        Note over CLI,SingularityMgr: All operations simulated
        SingularityMgr->>SingularityMgr: Simulate request creation
        SingularityMgr->>SingularityMgr: Simulate deploy creation
        SingularityMgr->>CLI: Preview of changes
        CLI-->>User: 🎭 Dry run results<br/>No actual changes made
    end